{"ref":"BDB, צִיץ","hw":"צִיץ","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צִיץ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.1\">Is 28:1</a></sup> <strong>1. blossom, flower</strong>. <strong>2. shining thing</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.7\">Is 40:7</a> +, cstr. v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.6\">6</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִצִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.18\">1 K 6:18</a> + 3 times 6 (on form v Kö<sup>ii. 1, 60</sup>);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>blossom, flower</em>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:23\" href=\"/Numbers.17.23\">Nu 17:23</a> (P; of Aaron’s rod); (fig. of man <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.7\">Is 40:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.8\">8</a> (both <span dir=\"rtl\">נָבֵל צ׳</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצִיר</span>), cf. sim. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיץ הַשָּׂדֶה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.6\">6</a> (‖ id.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:15\" href=\"/Psalms.103.15\">ψ 103:15</a>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> alone <a data-ref=\"Job 14:2\" href=\"/Job.14.2\">Jb 14:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ נֹבֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.1\">Is 28:1</a> (fig. of Samaria), so prob. also v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.4\">4</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיצַת נ׳</span>; so Marti); <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּטוּרֵי צִצִּים</span>, as ornaments of temple <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.18\">1 K 6:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:32\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:35\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.35\">35</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>shining thing</em>, plate of gold, constituting the diadem on front of high priest’s mitre, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.9\">Lv 8:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:36\" href=\"/Exodus.28.36\">Ex 28:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:30\" href=\"/Exodus.39.30\">39:30</a> (all P).—ii, iii. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיץ</span>, v. p. 851 infr.","next":"BDB, צִיצָה","prev":"BDB, צוּץ"}